    "updated_at": "2020-05-08T17:02:07Z",
    "body": "My guess would be that most web developers haven't heard of WebIDL records, and just think of them as \"objects\". If we end up preferring the name \"record\" in TC39 (it's the best we've come up with so far), I wonder if this name change on the WebIDL side is feasible. We can help with the editorial updates across spec-land if it comes to that.",
